    <string name="full_video_consent_title">Upload the whole video?</string>
    <string name="full_video_consent_body">By default only a few frames extracted on your phone are uploaded. Uploading the whole video sends the complete file to the VisualTrace server, which extracts frames and deletes the video immediately. It is never sent to third parties.</string>

